{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52519","headline":"其三 · 陈元光","name":"其三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地极绥安镇，天随使节存。\n民风移丑陋，土俗转醖醇。\n野服迎旌佩，獠草避阵云。\n宣威雄剑鼓，导化动琴樽。\n石裂磨刀处，溪留饮马痕。\n龙湖鱼鸟眼，认此第三巡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}